OL,3,GNEWSATfL faces charges after woman's
OL,4,Adeath at bus station
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) is to be
OL,7,Fprosecuted over alleged safety failures
OL,8,Fat Walthamstow bus station, where a
OL,9,Fwoman was struck by a bus and died.
OL,11,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,12,Falleges that between 1 January 2004 and
OL,13,F15 December 2023, TfL failed to ensure
OL,14,Ftraffic routes at the northern crossing
OL,15,Fof the station in north-east London
OL,16,Fwere suitable for the people and
OL,17,Fvehicles using them.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
