OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATfL faces charges after woman's
OL,4,Adeath at bus station
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrace Mecaley, a 74-year-old retired
OL,7,Fnurse, died after being hit by a route
OL,8,F212 bus at the station in December
OL,9,F2023. TfL has been approached for
OL,10,Fcomment.
OL,12,FThe first hearing is due at Westminster
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court on 25 September.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
